{
	"label": "Fuji",
	"description": "Mount Fuji is erupting. Your expedition must reach the village before the lava catches up, and everyone has to make it out alive.\n\n**Fuji is a cooperative dice game for 2–4 players.** Choose your routes together, then decide which dice to keep and which to reroll. Each destination rewards different colours or numbers, but your matching total must beat those of your neighbours. A great roll for you can become an obstacle for a teammate, and you must coordinate without revealing your exact dice.\n\nUse your character's skill, share equipment and manage your stamina as the escape routes disappear. Seven scenarios and four difficulty levels offer new challenges.",
	"players": [2, 3, 4],
	"credits": "- **Game design:** [Wolfgang Warsch](https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgamedesigner/80162/wolfgang-warsch)\n- **Illustrations:** [Weberson Santiago](https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgameartist/72369/weberson-santiago) · [Fuji artwork](https://webersonsantiago.com/project/fuji)\n- **Publisher:** [Feuerland Spiele](https://www.feuerland-spiele.de/)",
